    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=6$",
      "worked": "Multiply through by the lowest common denominator, $240$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}45(x-1)-100(x-4)&=96(x-6)+25\\\\45x-45-100x+400&=96x-576+25\\\\-55x+355&=96x-551\\\\151x&=906\\\\x&=6\\end{align*}$$",
